      "writtenOn": "2019-02-05T22:06:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I understand the reason for this but this raises some interesting testing and security issues if the migration version is fully functional. It probably makes sense for that migration capable version to only have a minimal feature set:\n1) the migration and\n2) updating to the next version\n\nThe migration flow could then be performed as part of the OS update and require an extra reboot to pick up the final Cr50 image, but the testing and security situation wouldn\u0027t be so bad in that case.\n\nForgive me if this is already covered in the design document.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 169,
        "startChar": 43,
        "endLine": 170,
        "endChar": 33
      },
      "revId": "aa191a18490a1f5637dfac3b5009b45dd7c9e743",
